{
  "id": "ss.enemy.shell",
  "name": "Bombardier shell",
  "description": "What a Bombardier lobs: a hot bead of its own chemistry, ember over an ink rim with a glow round it, and a short dark tail so it reads as thrown rather than floating. Drawn pointing +x; the game rotates it along its arc and draws `ss.fx.shadow` under it on the ground track.",
